        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "improve(ui): bring back openclaw brand + remove useless topbar and breadcrumbs",
        "body": "brand is important 🤓\r\n\r\n## What Problem This Solves\r\n\r\nThe desktop chat topbar was carrying controls that did not need to live there. The breadcrumb was not useful, and Search plus the sidebar toggle fit better in the existing sidebar pattern.\r\n\r\nThis PR brings the OpenClaw brand back to the sidebar, places Search and the sidebar toggle next to it, adds Cmd+B to open and close the sidebar, and keeps the mobile topbar with centered OpenClaw branding plus a Search icon.\r\n\r\nMobile top bar:\r\n<img width=\"521\" height=\"200\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f3f7675b-bdb7-4c35-ba60-6caa46853f9b\" />\r\n\r\nDesktop:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1568\" height=\"965\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f954e321-1a44-498a-908e-590e9ec00829\" />\r\n<img width=\"1570\" height=\"966\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/28e87659-4541-4c1c-a58b-ca05360c8cbc\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n## Why This Change Was Made\r\n\r\nThis keeps desktop navigation controls in the sidebar, where the app already has a calm and consistent pattern for global navigation. The terminal action moves to the chat workspace rail, so it stays available without bringing back the desktop topbar.\r\n\r\nMobile keeps the topbar because that is still the right place for drawer navigation and Search on small screens. It now shows the OpenClaw brand in the center and relegates Search to an icon on the right.\r\n\r\n## User Impact\r\n\r\nDesktop users get the brand back in the sidebar, fewer controls in the chat header area, and a keyboard shortcut for opening and closing the sidebar. Mobile users get a branded topbar with navigation on the left and Search on the right.\r\n\r\n## Evidence\r\n\r\n- `git diff --check origin/main...HEAD`\r\n- `pnpm exec oxfmt --check --threads=1 ui/src/app/app-host.ts ui/src/components/app-sidebar.ts ui/src/components/app-topbar.ts ui/src/components/terminal/terminal-panel.ts ui/src/pages/chat/chat-pane.ts ui/src/pages/chat/chat-state.ts ui/src/pages/chat/components/chat-session-workspace.ts ui/src/e2e/sidebar-customization.e2e.test.ts`\r\n- `pnpm --dir ui build`\r\n- Browser smoke: desktop topbar hidden, Cmd+B collapses/expands the sidebar with the logo top stable; mobile topbar shows centered OpenClaw branding, a Search icon on the right, no command-key hint, and Cmd+B opens the drawer.\r\n\r\nAI-assisted: yes; reviewed locally and validated with the commands above.\r\n",
